<view class="screen">
  <view class="brand"><image class="brand-icon" src="../../assets/chengzi-orbit.png" mode="aspectFit" aria-label="成子图标"/><view class="brand-copy"><text class="brand-name">成子</text><text class="brand-aside">陪你看懂关系</text></view><button class="brand-account" data-entry="account" bindtap="open">我的账户<image src="../../assets/ui-arrow.png"/></button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{hasPendingTasks}}" class="resume-panel"><text class="resume-title">接着上次</text><button wx:for="{{pendingTasks}}" wx:key="entry" data-entry="{{item.entry}}" bindtap="open"><view><text class="resume-name">{{item.label}}</text><text class="resume-state">{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view><text class="resume-action">继续查看 →</text></button></view>
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-content"><view class="eyebrow"><image src="../../assets/ui-sparkles.png"/><text>成子 · 关系决策智能体</text></view><view class="headline"><text>看懂关系。</text><text>也照顾你的感受。</text></view><view class="hero-sub"><text>从一句聊天，到一段关系。</text><text>那些没说清的在意，我们一起慢慢理清。</text></view><button class="hero-primary" data-entry="quick" bindtap="open">开启我的关系空间<text>↗</text></button><view class="privacy-note"><image src="../../assets/ui-shield.png"/><text>只处理你提供的内容 · 资料由你掌控</text></view></view>
    <view class="hero-scene aurora-scene {{motionPlaying && motionVisible ? '' : 'motion-paused'}}"><image class="hero-art" src="../../assets/aurora-fluted-light.jpg" mode="aspectFill" aria-hidden="true"/><view class="sunlight"/><view class="glass-label glass-label-one"><view/>从原话，看到依据</view><view class="glass-label glass-label-two"><view/>从变化，找到下一步</view><button class="motion-toggle" bindtap="toggleMotion" aria-label="{{motionPlaying ? '暂停光影动画' : '播放光影动画'}}"><image src="../../assets/ui-{{motionPlaying ? 'pause' : 'play'}}.png"/></button></view>
  </view>
  <button class="self-entry history-entry" data-entry="reports" bindtap="open"><image src="../../assets/ui-book.png"/><view><text>历史报告</text><text>全部分析，随时接着看</text></view><text>→</text></button>
  <view class="capability-strip"><view><image src="../../assets/ui-scan.png"/><text>多模态分析</text></view><view><image src="../../assets/ui-layers.png"/><text>长期关系记忆</text></view><view><image src="../../assets/ui-audio.png"/><text>实时语音</text></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loginState === 'connecting'}}" class="identity-note"><busy-indicator label="正在连接你的空间"/></view><button wx:elif="{{loginState === 'error'}}" class="identity-note identity-error" bindtap="retryLogin">重新连接微信身份<text>{{loginError}}</text></button>
  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-kicker">选择适合你的方式</text><text class="section-title">从这里，打开新的视角。</text></view>
  <button class="self-entry" data-entry="library" bindtap="open"><image src="../../assets/ui-chat.png"/><view><text>完整关系分析</text><text>基于全部聊天与朋友圈，生成完整报告</text></view><text>↗</text></button>
  <view class="entry-grid">
    <button class="entry-card" data-entry="quick" bindtap="open"><view class="entry-art"><image src="../../assets/ui-scan.png"/><view class="entry-ring"/></view><text class="entry-title">好感信号 · 每句意图 · 怎么回</text><text class="entry-description">聊天截图、语气与意图，让模糊的信号变得清晰。</text><view class="entry-action">分析聊天截图<text>↗</text></view></button>
    <button class="entry-card entry-warm" data-entry="social-profile" bindtap="open"><view class="entry-art"><image src="../../assets/ui-social.png"/><view class="entry-ring"/></view><text class="entry-title">看见更完整的对方</text><text class="entry-description">朋友圈、社交主页与照片，拼出一个人的轮廓。</text><view class="entry-action">分析社交资料<text>↗</text></view></button>
    <button class="entry-card" data-entry="chat" bindtap="open"><view class="entry-art"><image src="../../assets/ui-chat.png"/><view class="entry-ring"/></view><text class="entry-title">问成子</text><text class="entry-description">把困惑说出来，一起找到更有把握的下一步。</text><view class="entry-action">直接问成子<text>↗</text></view></button>
    <button class="entry-card" data-entry="voice" bindtap="open"><view class="entry-art"><image src="../../assets/ui-audio.png"/><view class="entry-ring"/></view><text class="entry-title">让想法自然流动</text><text class="entry-description">直接开口，带着你们的故事继续聊。</text><view class="entry-action">实时语音<text>↗</text></view></button>
  </view>
  <button class="relationship-card" data-entry="archive" bindtap="open"><view><text class="section-kicker">把每段关系接着了解</text><view class="relationship-title"><text>每一次变化，</text><text>都让你更了解彼此。</text></view><text class="relationship-description">人物档案 · 好感信号 · 适配分析 · 长期关系跟踪</text><view class="entry-action">打开人物档案<text>↗</text></view></view><image src="../../assets/ui-orbit.png"/></button>
  <button class="self-entry" data-entry="self" bindtap="open"><image src="../../assets/ui-user.png"/><view><text>快速认识我</text><text>选标签或说说自己 · 免费整理</text></view><text>↗</text></button>
  <button class="self-entry" data-entry="comparison" bindtap="open"><image src="../../assets/ui-users.png"/><view><text>人物对照</text><text>选 2–3 位，结合我的期待看差异</text></view><text>↗</text></button>
  <view class="knowledge-card"><view class="knowledge-heading"><image src="../../assets/ui-book.png"/><text>每个建议，都有依据</text></view><view class="knowledge-amount"><text>{{knowledgeWan}}</text><text>万字</text></view><text class="knowledge-caption">系统整理的情感与关系知识</text><text wx:if="{{knowledgeReferences}}" class="knowledge-reference-count">{{knowledgeReferences}} 条参考来源 · 心理学、法学、社会学</text><button class="knowledge-toggle" bindtap="toggleSources" aria-expanded="{{showSources}}"><text>{{showSources ? '收起知识库介绍' : '查看知识库内容与来源'}}</text><text>{{showSources ? '−' : '＋'}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{showSources}}" class="knowledge-detail"><text>{{knowledgeSources}} 份主题指南，汇集亲密关系、沟通、依恋与边界等理论与实践资料。结合聊天原话与已确认档案，给出判断和建议，再对照后续互动看变化。</text><text>参考示例：罗兰·米勒《亲密关系》、Rosenberg《非暴力沟通》及成人依恋研究。</text><text>字数包含资料整理与分析方法，并非原书全文。参考来源包含书籍、论文及公开资料。</text></view></view>
  <text class="bottom-note">分析前显示积分费用。是否保存资料，始终由你决定。</text>
  <main-navigation selected="home"/>
</view>
